            "title": "Constructor",
            "id": 88767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sınıftan farklı örnekler oluştururken kullanabileceğimiz daha esnek bir metot vardır. Buna <strong>constructor</strong> metodu denir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, color)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.color = color\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"benny = Virtual_Pet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;black&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(rocky.color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(benny.color)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"brown\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"black\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Constructor",
            "id": 89355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Constructor metodu <code>__init__()</code> şeklinde görünür ve bir örnek oluşturduğumuzda sınıf değişkenleri için benzersiz değerler ayarlamamızı sağlar.</p><p><code>init</code>'in her iki tarafında çift alt çizgi kullandığından emin ol.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, color)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.color = color\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>__init__</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Constructor",
            "id": 89359,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Her zaman aynı renge sahip olacak bir sınıf tanımı yerine, constructor metodu onu oluştururken ne istediğimizi belirtmemizi sağlar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, color)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.color = color\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Constructor",
            "id": 89360,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıf tanımından bir örnek oluşturduğumuzda, burada <code>yellow</code> ile olduğu gibi parantezlerin içine benzersiz değerler geçirebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, color)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.color = color\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"</code>, ardından <code>yellow</code> ve son olarak <code>\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıf tanımından bir örnek oluştururken parantezlerin içine benzersiz değerler geçirebiliriz.</p><p><code>rocky</code> örneğini <code>\"yellow\"</code> rengini tutan yeni bir örnek olarak oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Virtual_Pet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, color)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.color = color\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky = Virtual_Pet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"rocky\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>Virtual_Pet</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>\"yellow\"</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
